Now I have the files.

Current implementation in LiveRepaintOutput.php:
```php
it('resolves stream correctly for BufferedOutput', function () {
    $buffered = new \Symfony\Component\Console\Output\BufferedOutput(false);
    expect(LiveRepaintOutput::resolveStream($buffered))->toBeNull();
    expect(LiveRepaintOutput::supports($buffered))-> toBeFalse();
});
```

## Explanation

The test is added to LiveRepaintOutputTest.php to isolate the exact failure mode in resolveStream and supports when a non-stream BufferedOutput instance (decorated: false) is supplied. It instantiates BufferedOutput(false) directly from the Symfony namespace, bypassing any inheritance or 2nd-level getOutput() chaining that could indirectly surface a stream.

